# Bot1 controls no creature (only Moxen and the Jace token), Bot2 controls a Dryad Arbor. The granted -2 is activated anyway: the loyalty
# is paid (3), nothing is asked and nothing is sacrificed, so Bot2's Dryad Arbor stays and no Beast is made ("you may sacrifice a creature" is
# the activator's own, and nothing sacrificed means no "if you do").

